      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe if, when you click on a chair while in full body, it anchors your hip bone to the chair instead of the origin of your avatar. I know I'm usually sitting irl when I want to sit in full body, but it often takes a lot of fine tuning with playspace mover to get myself in the right position, with chair prefabs disabled. Having a chair automatically snap to your hips could make this easy, if it were implemented.",
